	"Description": "[size=3]┊⋆ ★┊Thank you for checking out!┊⋆ ★┊[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶[/size]\n<br />[url=https://www.i2symbol.com/symbols/plants]?[/url][size=3]\u00A0For the HD picture you must download\u00A0[/size][url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI[/url][size=3]\u00A0\u00A0+\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10971]HD Portraits[/url][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://emojipedia.org/four-leaf-clover/]?[/url][size=3]\u00A01- SMAPI: https://smapi.io/ &gt;&gt; Installing it will create the \"Mods\" folder inside your game folder.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://emojipedia.org/four-leaf-clover/]?[/url][size=3]\u00A02- Place HD Portraits inside the new \"Mods\" folder together with this mod![/size]\n<br />༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶\n<br />[size=3]\n<br />┊⋆ ★┊I've spent a long time on it, but I felt it was worth it! I wish my job was to make mods like this one, so I could make people happy while doing what I love the most! Please enjoy and have fun!┊⋆ ★┊\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://emojipedia.org/four-leaf-clover/]?[/url]\u00A0I am dead serious, if you want to pay me to do something I am very willing![/size]",
